a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\n<td>Manipulatable</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\n<td>Skill Required</td>\n<td><i>?</i> / <i>?</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\n<td>Teaching Cap</td>\n<td><i>?</i>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The musk hog has a scruffy, squat body that is brownish-gray.  An unpleasant odor hovers around the beast.  You can make out tiny bugs (maybe fleas?) hopping around on its dirty coat.  Its broad, flat snout is constantly twitching.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"In_Depth\">In Depth</span></h2></div>"}}